        {
          "key": "c",
          "text": "PostgreSQL views expose the internal state of sessions and objects",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "d",
          "text": "PostgreSQL internal statistics completely replace OS monitoring",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The material treats the two levels as complementary: the OS shows resources and processes, while PostgreSQL shows the server's internal state.",
      "source": {
